    <briefdescription>
<para>Singleton manager for gamepad input using SDL3 Gamepad API. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides a unified interface for detecting and querying gamepad state (buttons, axes, triggers, and rumble). Supports multiple players and handles gamepad connection/disconnection events.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>This class is a singleton to ensure a single point of control for all gamepad input across the engine. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para>SDL_Gamepad, SDL_JoystickID </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
